  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large deep skillet or Dutch oven over medium heat. Add the onion and cook 4 minutes, until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic, ginger, curry powder, turmeric, and cumin. Cook 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the tofu and sweet potatoes. Stir to coat in the spices and cook 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in the diced tomatoes with their juice, the coconut milk, the water, and the salt. Stir and scrape up any browned bits.",
    "Bring to a simmer, then cover and reduce the heat to medium-low. Cook 12 to 15 minutes, stirring once or twice, until a fork slides easily into the sweet potato.",
    "Add the spinach by handfuls and stir until wilted, about 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and add a pinch more salt if needed. Serve hot, or cool and store in a covered container in the fridge for up to 4 days."
  ],
